{
  "question_id": "q_057_alibaba_compressed_mode",
  "slug": "alibaba-compressed-mode",
  "title": "Compressed Mode",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "company": "Alibaba",
  "premium": false,
  "question": "Alibaba's inventory team wants to identify the **mode of order sizes**—the item count that appeared most frequently across all customer orders.\n\nIn the `items_per_order` table:\n• `item_count` is the quantity of items purchased.\n• `order_occurrences` is how many orders had that quantity.\n\nWrite a query to find the item count (or item counts) with the highest frequency of occurrences (`mode`). If multiple item counts tie for the highest frequency, display all tied item counts sorted in ascending order.",
  "notes": [
    "item_count: Represents the number of items sold in each order.",
    "order_occurrences: Represents the frequency of orders with the corresponding number of items sold per order.",
    "For example, if there are 800 orders with 3 items sold in each order, the record would have an item_count of 3 and an order_occurrences of 800.",
    "Based on the example output, the order_occurrences value of 1000 corresponds to the highest frequency among all item counts. This means that item count of 2 has occurred 1000 times, making it the mode of order occurrences."
  ],
  "tables": [
    {
      "table_name": "items_per_order",
      "columns": [
        {
          "column_name": "item_count",
          "data_type": "INT"
        },
        {
          "column_name": "order_occurrences",
          "data_type": "INT"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sample_data": {
    "items_per_order": [
      {
        "item_count": "1",
        "order_occurrences": "500"
      },
      {
        "item_count": "2",
        "order_occurrences": "1000"
      },
      {
        "item_count": "3",
        "order_occurrences": "800"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sample_output": [
    {
      "mode": 2
    }
  ],
  "reference_sql": "SELECT item_count AS mode\nFROM items_per_order\nWHERE order_occurrences = (SELECT MAX(order_occurrences) FROM items_per_order)\nORDER BY item_count;",
  "tags": [
    "aggregation",
    "alibaba",
    "ecommerce",
    "medium"
  ],
